    "what": "added the per-row field denial_kind: POLICY_PROHIBITED | NO_CAPABILITY | null",
    "why": "a denial must say whether the capability is absent or forbidden, because the two reach different contract obligations: an absent capability is REPORT_CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE (contract 13.1) while a prohibition is a policy refusal. messaging.system_egress and resource.control name real, existing surfaces forbidden by D-06 and D-07, so reporting them as 'not registered' was wrong.",
